Parkour

Parser combinators for human-authored text (config files, DSLs, small
languages): precise, well-rendered syntax errors, opt-in error recovery, and
zero runtime dependencies beyond the OCaml standard library.

Status: early development, not yet released. Only the project skeleton exists;
there is no usable parsing API yet.

Build and test:

  dune build              build the library
  dune test               fast test tier
  dune build @test-long   extensive test tier (QCheck --long)

License: MIT (see LICENSE).
